third-party library source copied into this repository is the vendored
`portable-pty` tree (`vendor/portable-pty`; upstream MIT, see its
`LICENSE.md`, plus herdr's Apache-2.0 patch and the local Devboule
modification noted above). This does not
mean that linked dependency code is absent from a built binary; the
